      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This functionality should be priority 1 for CE and if it turns out it's being held up by trying to make it in-client instead of the already proven and accessible model of doing avatar package sales on a website that can be accessed on literally any device, there is a serious issue going on with putting premature optimization ahead of achieving base functionality.\n\nThe fact this has only 3 voters (currently) is not an indication of it being unimportant. Posts about the tip jars probably have tons and tons of votes, but just 1 popular avatar base put up for sale on this platform alone would probably dwarf all of the fee revenue from tip jars. Please think about it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
