  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-16T01:27:30.221Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A lot of avatar base creators like myself work full time making content for VRChat. Gumroad, as well as other marketplace platforms, have become wildly unstable for creators as of recent, giving VRChat a massive opportunity to step in, I know this is something that has been teased but i would like to suggest that the VRChat team do a survey of creators like myself to find out what we would value in a market platform including fee structures, features, potential vcc integrations and stuff like that.\n\nI would love to see vrchat work with the community to create a marketplace platform for avatars that would benefit both the platform and those selling on it over the currently disjointed system where platforms take advantage of creators with little market pressure.",
